ere where that angle is greater  than 90 degrees so if we look at our  example right over here this is less  than 90 degrees this is less than 90  degrees and that is less than 90 degrees  so it is an acute  it is an acute triangle when you look at  it from a point of angles so you could  call this triangle an acute scalene  triangle
 

